// How every aircraft the pilot can steal flies (openspec change fly-stolen-aircraft, design sections 2 and 3; owner,
// 2026-10-30: "The player can steal those and planes as well", flight model "Simulated"). Keyed as the kinds in
// data/world/air_traffic.ron. Starting numbers from public data for the real aircraft each model is after, retuned
// from play: masses at a light operating weight, wing areas and spans the real ones, thrust at sea level, inertias
// scaled from published values for the class. `trim_m_s` is the speed each is trimmed for (the auto-trim's level
// flight); `rest_m` is each model's own (its manifest's, checked by the tests); `elevator_alpha_rad`, `roll_rate_deg_s`
// and `rudder_beta_rad` are the control authority in plain terms.
